ipmb: add Node Manager CPU temperature class

The Intel ME on Grantley boards does not expose the CPU temperatures as
IPMI sensors. They are read with the Node Manager command "Get CPU and
Memory Temperature" (NetFn 0x2e, cmd 0x4b), which returns the margin to
Tjmax per CPU. Add the class "NMCpuTemp"; "Address" is the CPU index.

Upstream-Status: Pending

